          "existing_implementation": "Existing Linux application package (web/API tier and import process) is redeployed unchanged except for logged configuration, object-storage and compatibility corrections.",
          "gap": "Instance sizes are confirmed at G1.",
          "implementation": "Internal ALB with an HTTPS listener using an imported certificate, health checks and a security group restricted to approved test-client CIDRs. Two EC2 nodes, one per AZ, run in an Auto Scaling group with fixed capacity of 2. An unhealthy node is removed from the target group and replaced from the launch template."
